3", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298281_1618125379660636_97497230603110810_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=puxneEacFeIQ7kNvwFejg3_&_nc_oc=AdqYHRGPDL8PTtXqKRyhqKYjDfGjZJioioWplMU5woSIIeDSM5KDwis42xQ_G3NkOv4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTQwBc_ROjpIXW2j5MNt4ZZ7pQRioiaCen_0d2NO_bNqw&oe=6B0DAFD6"}, {"file_name": "VR 8.png", "id": "1671554027276076", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831393_1671554030609409_6402991576025029018_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MC3KdtdO_MQQ7kNvwGQFoop&_nc_oc=AdozKS0el_APnVayyp5JwOYfWhDlvORp2Pzh2fDX_mbYSE0Hjhxgqp5jaIWjCTOsFTc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSrZHL_wckhwlvBJvpaPjbJxgAlj_uEBDy2omcM-pXXxg&oe=6B0DA8CA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MedRoom Anatomy", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Compreenda e visualize o corpo humano completo!\nAprender anatomia por meio de uma tecnologia imersiva consolida o conhecimento e permite uma compreens\u00e3o mais aprofundada da topografia do corpo humano. \nO MedRoom Anatomy possibilita estudar a anatomia de forma mais f\u00e1cil, intuitiva e din\u00e2mica. \nFeito para professores, alunos e profissionais da \u00e1rea da sa\u00fade, apresenta como principais caracter\u00edsticas:\n- Dois modelos completos, feminino e masculino, com mais de 3500 estruturas em 3D modeladas\n- Ferramentas como: ocultar, isolar, transparecer e destacar para disseca\u00e7\u00e3o das estruturas\n- Filtro f\u00e1cil e din\u00e2mico por sistemas e regi\u00f5es do corpo\n- Anima\u00e7\u00e3o de estruturas, como o ciclo card\u00edaco\n- Personaliza\u00e7\u00e3o da ferramenta, via controle \n\n\n", "short_description": "Estude o corpo humano, com alto detalhamento e pr\u00f3ximo da realidade!\nNossa aplica\u00e7\u00e3o apresenta o corpo humano, tanto masculino quanto feminino, com mais de 3000 estruturas modeladas e validadas cientificamente.  Projetado para ser um laborat\u00f3rio de anatomia em realidade virtual, a ferramenta possibilita a compreens\u00e3o topogr\u00e1fica, a rela\u00e7\u00e3o entre os sistemas, \u00f3rg\u00e3os e regi\u00f5es do corpo. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.medroom.com.br/politica", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Anatomia completa em 3D", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.medroom.com.br/anatomy", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "pt_BR", "es_AR"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "28294936860149538"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618432_734832196347379_5113041312721428738_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ppzoKaPny8gQ7kNvwE8tQXF&_nc_oc=AdoRf_7f40MRHMz5cs6Zs8opcjjtHIvH61CECPeSr89aFYPvLNiCJR43y2qqBVVn6Js&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSBYS1ZmXsDzLiDsKN6Fd5nJJMJ-YDwBYE1XUYimsrW_Q&oe=6B0DA2B3"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "MedRoom Anatomy", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "APPS", "id": "362692211442873"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Learning", "id"